                                "sense_id": "d460b290-aaa0-3475-bf28-006e959e2842",
                                "text": "But go anywhere else in the Middle East and Zionism stands for theft, oppression, racist exclusionism."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a74cee5b-3e2d-3ccc-bf3d-9300a513808d",
                        "entry_id": "ea2c43dd-753d-3b73-9bf8-c63bacc85f16",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A policy or ideology that favors exclusion of some individuals or groups from a nation, sect, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "48855010-d4f7-4dea-8682-93dde27ac65e",
                                "sense_id": "a74cee5b-3e2d-3ccc-bf3d-9300a513808d",
                                "text": "The true explanation of the rise of the traditional policy we believe to be commercial jealousy, which blossomed and burgeoned out into religious exclusionism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc53ebe1-d552-4047-81f4-1af06f0be157",
                                "sense_id": "a74cee5b-3e2d-3ccc-bf3d-9300a513808d",
                                "text": "Exclusionism, then, cannot be an item of the configuration “Asia for Asians,” in economic activities or cultural achievements. It is in political relations, however, that exclusionism is the supreme reality."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
